and don't let them attack from a distance. Usually in company of <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mages</a>.\nBe careful, as this creature is strong and can kill an inexperienced player pretty quickly. <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Rings</a> can be a big help when facing many of these.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 33,180 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bolt\"><img alt=\"Bolt\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bolt_f6df50.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Bolt\">Bolt</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-20</td>\n<td>6.4</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"90.060277\" style=\"text-align:center;\">90%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-30</td>\n<td>5.5</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"74.963834\" style=\"text-align:center;